 52367                           ;	BOOTCOE = HALT, CRC on boot will stop device if error is detected in boot areas
 52368                           ;	CRC on boot application code scan enable
 52369                           ;	APPSCEN = OFF, CRC on boot will not include the application area of program memory in 
      +                          its calculation
 52370                           ;	CRC on boot SAF area scan enable
 52371                           ;	SAFSCEN = OFF, CRC on boot will not include the SAF area of program memory in its calc
      +                          ulation
 52372                           ;	CRC on boot Data EEPROM scan enable
 52373                           ;	DATASCEN = OFF, CRC on boot will not include data EEPROM in its calculation
 52374                           ;	CRC on boot Config fuses scan enable
 52375                           ;	CFGSCEN = OFF, CRC on boot will not include the configuration fuses in its calculation
 52376                           ;	CRC on boot Continue on Error for non-boot areas bit
 52377                           ;	COE = HALT, CRC on boot will stop device if error is detected in non-boot areas
 52378                           ;	Boot on CRC Enable bit
